    "CoiStatement": "This study was funded by Sunovion Pharmaceuticals Inc. Martha Sajatovic is an employee of Case Western Reserve University (Cleveland, OH, USA) and of University Hospitals Cleveland Medical Center (Cleveland, OH, USA). Daisy Ng-Mak, Krithika Rajagopalan, and Antony Loebel are employees of Sunovion Pharmaceuticals Inc (Marlborough, MA, USA). Caitlyn Solem and Fang-Ju Lin are employees of Pharmerit International (Bethesda, MD, USA) and were paid consultants to Sunovion (Marlborough, MA, USA) in the development and execution of this study.",
